#: ../../learn/providers.rst:66
msgid ""
"The adapter normalizes messages, tools, and events, not the capabilities "
"of every model. Pick an endpoint and model that support your workflow. In"
" particular, images, visible reasoning, hosted tools, and tool search are"
" not available on every endpoint. This runtime does not expose a general "
"``response_format`` or structured-final-output setting; for validated "
"data, use a typed tool or validate the final answer in your application."
msgstr ""
"适配器负责统一消息、工具和事件，但不统一每个模型的能力。请选择与你的工作流相匹配的端点和模型。尤其是，图像、可见推理、托管工具和工具搜索并非在所有端点上可用。本运行时不提供通用的"
" ``response_format`` 或结构化最终输出设置；如果需要经过校验的数据，请使用带类型的工具，或在应用中校验最终答案。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:74
msgid "Configure your chosen provider"
msgstr "配置你选定的模型提供商"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:76
msgid ""
"Read credentials and model names from your environment. Every tab creates"
" a ``model`` you can pass to ``create_agent``; close it with ``await "
"model.aclose()`` when finished. These snippets configure real services "
"and are not offline examples."
msgstr ""
"从环境变量中读取凭据和模型名称。每个标签页都会创建一个可传给 ``create_agent`` 的 ``model``；使用完毕后用 "
"``await model.aclose()`` 关闭它。这些代码片段配置的是真实服务，并非离线示例。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "OpenAI"
msgstr "OpenAI"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:96
msgid ""
"``response=True`` selects the Responses API. Omit it for Chat Completions"
" (the default). Choose a protocol supported by your endpoint; enabling "
"this flag does not add Responses support to a gateway."
msgstr ""
"``response=True`` 会选择 Responses API。省略它则使用 Chat "
"Completions（默认）。请选择端点支持的协议；启用这个标志并不会给网关增加 Responses 支持。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Anthropic"
msgstr "Anthropic"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:112
msgid "Uses the Messages API. ``response=True`` is not supported."
msgstr "使用 Messages API。不支持 ``response=True``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Google"
msgstr "Google"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:126
msgid ""
"Uses Google GenAI with an API key. ``base_url`` points it at a proxy or a"
" local test server. The built-in constructor does not expose Vertex AI "
"project/location configuration."
msgstr ""
"使用 API 密钥访问 Google GenAI。\\ ``base_url`` 可以把它指向代理或本地测试服务器。内置构造函数不提供 "
"Vertex AI 项目/位置配置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "DeepSeek"
msgstr "DeepSeek"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:142
msgid ""
"Uses Chat Completions by default. ``response=True`` selects a Responses-"
"compatible endpoint when your service supports it."
msgstr "默认使用 Chat Completions。当你的服务支持时，``response=True`` 会选择兼容 Responses 的端点。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "OpenRouter"
msgstr "OpenRouter"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:159
msgid ""
"``site_url`` and ``app_name`` are optional and identify your app to "
"OpenRouter. Reasoning that a model returns in a form that cannot be shown"
" as text is kept and sent back unchanged, which models that sign or "
"encrypt their reasoning need across a tool call."
msgstr ""
"``site_url`` 和 ``app_name`` 都是可选的，用来向 OpenRouter "
"标识你的应用。模型如果以无法显示为文本的形式（加密或摘要）返回推理内容，这些内容会被保留并原样回传。对推理带签名或被加密的模型来说，跨越一次工具调用时这是必需的。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Kimi"
msgstr "Kimi"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:176
msgid ""
"The default endpoint is ``https://api.moonshot.ai/v1``. An account on the"
" China platform passes ``base_url=\"https://api.moonshot.cn/v1\"``; keys "
"do not work across the two."
msgstr ""
"默认端点是 ``https://api.moonshot.ai/v1``\\ 。中国站的账号请传入 "
"``base_url=\"https://api.moonshot.cn/v1\"``；两个平台的密钥不能互通。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "GLM"
msgstr "GLM"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:192
msgid ""
"The default endpoint is ``https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4``. An account on "
"the China platform passes "
"``base_url=\"https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4\"``. "
"``tool_stream=True`` streams a tool call's arguments as they are written."
msgstr ""
"默认端点是 ``https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4``\\ 。中国站的账号请传入 "
"``base_url=\"https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4\"``\\ 。\\ "
"``tool_stream=True`` 会在工具调用的参数生成时就流式送出，而不是等到全部写完。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "xAI"
msgstr "xAI"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:210
msgid ""
"xAI calls Chat Completions its legacy endpoint, and its hosted web and X "
"search tools are on Responses, which ``response=True`` selects. The level"
" is sent only to ``grok-4.5`` and later."
msgstr ""
"xAI 把 Chat Completions 称为其旧版端点，托管的网页搜索和 X 搜索工具只在 Responses 上提供，用 "
"``response=True`` 即可选用。推理等级只会发送给 ``grok-4.5`` 及之后的模型。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "MiniMax"
msgstr "MiniMax"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:226
msgid ""
"The default endpoint is ``https://api.minimax.io/v1``. An account on the "
"China platform passes ``base_url=\"https://api.minimaxi.com/v1\"``. "
"``MiniMaxAnthropicProvider`` is the same service over Messages."
msgstr ""
"默认端点是 ``https://api.minimax.io/v1``\\ 。中国站的账号请传入 "
"``base_url=\"https://api.minimaxi.com/v1\"``\\ 。\\ ``MiniMaxAnthropicProvider`` "
"是同一项服务的 Messages 版本。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "Ollama"
msgstr "Ollama"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:242
msgid ""
"Start Ollama and install the selected model separately. Construction does"
" not start a server or download a model. No API key is required for a "
"local service; this adapter uses Ollama's chat protocol only."
msgstr ""
"请单独启动 Ollama 并安装所选模型。构造适配器不会启动服务器，也不会下载模型。本地服务无需 API 密钥；此适配器只使用 Ollama 的 "
"chat 协议。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:247
msgid "A complete tool-calling request"
msgstr "一次完整的工具调用请求"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:249
msgid ""
"This program makes a real network request and may incur charges. Export "
"the variables in your shell rather than pasting keys into source or logs."
" The program registers an addition tool, streams the response, and closes"
" the provider even if the request fails."
msgstr ""
"这个程序会发起真实的网络请求，可能产生费用。请在 shell "
"中导出环境变量，不要把密钥粘贴到源码或日志里。程序会注册一个加法工具、流式输出响应，并在请求失败时也关闭模型提供商。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:258
msgid ":download:`Download real_provider.py <../_examples/real_provider.py>`."
msgstr ":download:`下载 real_provider.py <../_examples/real_provider.py>`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:266
msgid ""
"From an installed package, download the file and run ``python "
"real_provider.py``. The exact wording and whether the model obeys the "
"tool request depend on the selected model. To verify the same tool round "
"trip deterministically, run :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用已安装的包，请下载该文件并运行 ``python real_provider.py``\\ "
"。具体措辞以及模型是否遵循工具请求，取决于所选的模型。要确定性地验证相同的工具往返，请运行 :doc:`../examples"
"/streaming-tools`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:272
msgid "Connect a compatible gateway"
msgstr "连接兼容的网关"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:274
msgid ""
"Use ``base_url`` for a service implementing an existing protocol instead "
"of writing a new adapter:"
msgstr "对于实现了现有协议的服务，请使用 ``base_url``，而不必编写新的适配器："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:286
msgid ""
"The URL is the API root, for example a service's ``.../v1``, not its "
"``.../chat/completions`` route. Match the protocol to the gateway. Some "
"gateways reject optional fields such as ``prompt_cache_key`` or "
"particular reasoning levels; configure only supported options and test "
"your combination. The adapter does not auto-detect model capabilities "
"from an endpoint URL."
msgstr ""
"URL 应指向 API 根路径，例如服务的 ``.../v1``，而不是它的 ``.../chat/completions`` "
"路由。请让协议与网关匹配。有些网关会拒绝可选字段，比如 ``prompt_cache_key`` "
"或某些推理级别；请只配置受支持的选项，并测试你的组合。适配器不会从端点 URL 自动探测模型能力。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:292
msgid ""
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai.OpenAIProvider` speaks OpenAI's own "
"dialect: it sends ``parallel_tool_calls`` and a top-level "
"``reasoning_effort``. A gateway that rejects either can use "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai_compatible.OpenAICompatibleProvider`"
" instead, which sends only the ``reasoning_effort`` and takes the same "
"``base_url``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai.OpenAIProvider` 说的是 OpenAI "
"自己的方言：它会发送 ``parallel_tool_calls`` 和顶层的 ``reasoning_effort``\\ "
"。网关如果拒绝其中任何一个，可以改用 "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai_compatible.OpenAICompatibleProvider`，它只发送"
" ``reasoning_effort``，并接受同样的 ``base_url``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:300
msgid "Services that need no adapter of their own"
msgstr "无需专用适配器的服务"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:302
msgid ""
"These services speak a protocol the generic adapters already handle. Pass"
" the root as ``base_url``; give a model its reasoning options in "
"``extra_body``. The roots below were checked to answer on the network, "
"not exercised with a chat request, so confirm the root, the model names, "
"and the options in the service's own documentation before relying on "
"them."
msgstr ""
"这些服务说的是通用适配器已经支持的协议。把根地址作为 ``base_url`` 传入，模型的推理选项放在 "
"``extra_body`` 里。下表中的根地址只验证过网络上有应答，并没有用聊天请求实测过，因此依赖它们之前，"
"请先对照服务自己的文档确认根地址、模型名称和选项。"

