"其他的用一个字符串类型加一个配置映射即可声明。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:378
msgid "Write a provider for another compatible service"
msgstr "为另一个兼容服务编写适配器"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:380
msgid ""
"Most services that speak Chat Completions bend it in a few places: the "
"field that carries reasoning, how thinking is switched on and off, an "
"identifying header. Each is a method that "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai_compatible.OpenAICompatibleProvider`"
" calls, so a provider for one more service is a subclass that overrides "
"only the places where the service differs:"
msgstr ""
"大多数支持 Chat Completions 的服务都会在少数几处对它做些改动：承载推理内容的字段、思考如何开关、一个标识用的请求头。每一处都是 "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.openai_compatible.OpenAICompatibleProvider`"
" 调用的一个方法，所以为又一个服务写适配器，就是写一个子类，只覆盖该服务与标准协议不同的地方："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:410 ../../learn/providers.rst:444
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:411 ../../learn/providers.rst:445
msgid "Override it when"
msgstr "在这些情况下覆盖它"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:412 ../../learn/providers.rst:446
msgid "``vendor_headers``"
msgstr "``vendor_headers``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:413 ../../learn/providers.rst:447
msgid "The service wants headers on every request."
msgstr "服务要求每个请求都带上某些请求头。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:414 ../../learn/providers.rst:448
msgid "``request_fields``"
msgstr "``request_fields``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:415
msgid ""
"The service spells the reasoning level, or takes other options, in the "
"request body."
msgstr "服务在请求体里用自己的写法表达推理等级，或接受其他选项。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:416
msgid "``replay_reasoning``"
msgstr "``replay_reasoning``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:417
msgid ""
"An earlier assistant turn must be sent back in a form of the service's "
"own."
msgstr "较早的助手回合必须以服务自己的形式回传。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:418
msgid "``read_delta`` and ``reasoning_keys``"
msgstr "``read_delta`` 和 ``reasoning_keys``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:419
msgid ""
"A streamed delta carries reasoning, or other data, under names the plain "
"protocol does not use."
msgstr "流式增量里的推理内容或其他数据，使用了标准协议没有的字段名。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:420
msgid "``merge_replay``"
msgstr "``merge_replay``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:421
msgid ""
"Opaque blocks arrive in pieces that must be put together before they are "
"sent back."
msgstr "不透明的块是分片到达的，回传之前必须先拼起来。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:422
msgid "``read_usage``"
msgstr "``read_usage``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:423
msgid "The token counts use names that the default reader does not know."
msgstr "token 计数使用了默认读取器不认识的字段名。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:424
msgid "``chat_stop``"
msgstr "``chat_stop``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:425
msgid "The service has finish reasons of its own."
msgstr "服务有自己专用的结束原因。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:426 ../../learn/providers.rst:456
msgid "``status_error``"
msgstr "``status_error``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:427 ../../learn/providers.rst:457
msgid "The service explains an HTTP failure in a body of its own."
msgstr "服务用自己格式的响应体解释 HTTP 失败。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:429
msgid ""
"A method that is not overridden does what the plain protocol does, so a "
"provider stays as small as the ways its service differs. The built-in "
"OpenRouter, Kimi and GLM providers are written this way."
msgstr ""
"没有被覆盖的方法就按标准协议处理，因此一个适配器有多大，只取决于它的服务与标准协议有多少不同。内置的 OpenRouter、Kimi 和 GLM "
"适配器就是这样写的。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:433
msgid ""
"The Messages protocol works the same way through "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.anthropic_compatible.AnthropicCompatibleProvider`,"
" which :class:`~zett_agent.providers.anthropic.AnthropicProvider` and the"
" Messages providers for DeepSeek, Kimi and GLM are built on. Its hooks "
"are the places where services differ most, and the plain Anthropic "
"behavior is what a hook does when it is not overridden:"
msgstr ""
"Messages 协议的做法相同，入口是 "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.anthropic_compatible.AnthropicCompatibleProvider`，它是"
" :class:`~zett_agent.providers.anthropic.AnthropicProvider` 以及 "
"DeepSeek、Kimi 和 GLM 的 Messages 适配器的基础。它的钩子正是各服务差异最大的地方；钩子没有被覆盖时，做的就是标准的 "
"Anthropic 行为："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:449
msgid ""
"The service takes the reasoning level in a field of its own, or rejects "
"the adaptive thinking Anthropic uses."
msgstr "服务把推理等级放在自己的字段里，或者拒绝 Anthropic 使用的自适应思考。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:450
msgid "``mark_cache``"
msgstr "``mark_cache``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:451
msgid ""
"The service ignores the cache markers Anthropic needs, or reads them "
"somewhere else."
msgstr "服务忽略 Anthropic 需要的缓存标记，或者在别的位置读取它们。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:452
msgid "``start_usage`` and ``finish_usage``"
msgstr "``start_usage`` 和 ``finish_usage``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:453
msgid "The token counts carry more than Anthropic's, such as reasoning tokens."
msgstr "token 计数比 Anthropic 的更多，例如推理 token。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:454
msgid "``message_stop``"
msgstr "``message_stop``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:455
msgid "The service has stop reasons of its own."
msgstr "服务有自己专用的停止原因。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:455
msgid ""
"``mark_stable_cache`` is the narrower hook that ``CacheMode.READ`` calls. "
"Override it when the service's stable prefix needs different markers; the "
"default marks the last loaded tool and the system prompt. If you override "
"``mark_cache``, override this hook too, or ``READ`` falls back to the base "
"markers."
msgstr "``mark_stable_cache`` 是 ``CacheMode.READ`` 调用的更窄钩子。当服务端的稳定前缀需要不同的标记时覆盖它；默认会标记最后一个加载的工具和 system prompt。如果覆盖了\\ ``mark_cache``\\ ，也请覆盖这个钩子，否则 ``READ`` 会退回基础标记。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:459
msgid ""
"Two class attributes cover the rest: ``bearer_auth = True`` also sends "
"the key as ``Authorization: Bearer``, for a service that takes only that,"
" and ``native_deferred_tools`` stays ``False`` unless the service itself "
"loads a tool when a ``tool_reference`` names it, which only Anthropic "
"does."
msgstr ""
"另有两个类属性负责其余的差异：``bearer_auth = True`` 会把密钥同时作为 ``Authorization: Bearer`` "
"发送，适用于只接受这种认证的服务；``native_deferred_tools`` 保持 ``False``，除非服务自身能在 "
"``tool_reference`` 点名时加载工具——目前只有 Anthropic 做得到。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:465
msgid "Send extra headers, query parameters, or body fields"
msgstr "发送额外的请求头、查询参数或请求体字段"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:467
msgid ""
"Gateways often route, bill, or version on something the adapters do not "
"model. Every adapter accepts ``extra_headers``; the OpenAI-style and "
"Anthropic adapters also take ``extra_query`` and ``extra_body``, Google "
"takes ``extra_body`` and ``base_url``, and Ollama takes ``extra_query``."
msgstr ""
"网关常常依据适配器没有建模的信息来路由、计费或区分版本。每个适配器都接受 ``extra_headers``；OpenAI 风格的适配器和 "
"Anthropic 适配器还接受 ``extra_query`` 和 ``extra_body``，Google 接受 "
"``extra_body`` 和 ``base_url``，Ollama 接受 ``extra_query``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:483
msgid ""
"Headers and query parameters go on every request after the adapter's own,"
" so one given here replaces the SDK default of the same name (use it for "
"``User-Agent`` or an ``anthropic-beta`` flag). ``extra_body`` is merged "
"into the request body last: it adds options the adapter does not model "
"and may also override ones it does, such as DeepSeek's ``thinking``. The "
"values are copied and validated when the provider is built, and "
"``extra_body`` must be JSON."
msgstr ""
"请求头和查询参数会附加在适配器自身的参数之后，用于每一个请求，因此这里给出的同名参数会替换 SDK 的默认值（可用于 ``User-Agent``"
" 或 ``anthropic-beta`` 标志）。\\ ``extra_body`` "
"最后才合并进请求体：它可以添加适配器没有建模的选项，也可以覆盖适配器已有的选项，例如 DeepSeek 的 ``thinking``\\ "
"。这些值会在构造提供商时被复制并校验，且 ``extra_body`` 必须是 JSON。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:491
msgid "Reasoning effort"
msgstr "推理强度"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:493
msgid ""
"Set a provider-neutral level on the run instead of vendor-specific "
"options:"
msgstr "在运行上设置与提供商无关的级别，而不是使用厂商专属选项："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:505
msgid "Level"
msgstr "级别"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:506
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:507
msgid "``MINIMAL``"
msgstr "``MINIMAL``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:508
msgid "Request a minimal reasoning budget when the model supports it."
msgstr "在模型支持时请求最小的推理预算。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:509
msgid "``LOW`` / ``MEDIUM``"
msgstr "``LOW`` / ``MEDIUM``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:510
msgid "Lower or moderate effort; ``MEDIUM`` is the runtime default."
msgstr "较低的或中等的强度；``MEDIUM`` 是运行时默认值。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:511
msgid "``HIGH`` / ``XHIGH``"
msgstr "``HIGH`` / ``XHIGH``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:512
msgid "Request more effort for difficult multi-step tasks."
msgstr "对于困难的多步骤任务请求更高的强度。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:513
msgid "``MAX`` / ``ULTRA``"
msgstr "``MAX`` / ``ULTRA``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:514
msgid ""
"Highest requested levels; an adapter may map them to the same supported "
"setting."
msgstr "请求的最高级别；适配器可能将它们映射到同一个受支持的设置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:515
msgid "``OFF``"
msgstr "``OFF``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:516
msgid "Omit or disable explicit reasoning configuration according to the adapter."
msgstr "根据适配器的不同，省略或禁用显式的推理配置。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:518
msgid ""
"The current Responses adapter maps ``XHIGH``, ``MAX``, and ``ULTRA`` to "
"``high``. The Anthropic adapter sends adaptive thinking with the level as"
" ``output_config.effort`` (``low``, ``medium``, ``high``, ``xhigh``, "
"``max``; ``MINIMAL`` shares ``low`` and ``ULTRA`` shares ``max``) and "
"sets no token budget. Google still turns the level into a "
"``thinking_budget``, which groups the highest levels. OpenAI Chat "
"Completions forwards named levels, so a model that rejects one can still "
"raise an endpoint error. OpenRouter sends the level as "
"``reasoning.effort``; Kimi and GLM send the three levels they know "
"(``low``, ``high``, ``max``) and only to the models that take them. xAI, "
"MiniMax, Groq and Cerebras do the same per model family, and Mistral and "
"the plain hosting services send no level because their models disagree on"
" the names: pass one in ``extra_body``. xAI cannot switch reasoning off, "
"so ``OFF`` is sent as ``low``. The GLM Messages adapter still sends the "
"token budget Z.ai documents. The runtime does not negotiate supported "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"当前的 Responses 适配器把 ``XHIGH``、``MAX`` 和 ``ULTRA`` 都映射为 ``high``\\ 。Anthropic "
"适配器发送自适应思考，并把等级放在 ``output_config.effort``\\ （``low``\\ 、\\ ``medium``\\ 、\\ ``high``\\ 、"
"``xhigh``\\ 、\\ ``max``\\ ；\\ ``MINIMAL`` 与 ``low`` 相同，``ULTRA`` 与 ``max`` 相同）中，不设置 token "
"预算。Google 仍然把等级转成 ``thinking_budget``，最高几个等级会归并。OpenAI Chat "
"Completions 原样转发等级名，因此模型如果拒绝某个等级，仍可能触发端点错误。OpenRouter 把等级作为 "
"``reasoning.effort`` 发送；Kimi 和 GLM 发送它们认识的三个等级（``low``、``high``、``max``），"
"并且只发送给支持它们的模型。xAI、MiniMax、Groq 和 Cerebras 按模型系列做同样的事；Mistral "
"和那些普通托管服务不发送等级，因为它们托管的模型在名称上各不相同，需要的话请在 ``extra_body`` 中传入。"
"xAI 无法关闭推理，所以 ``OFF`` 会以 ``low`` 发送。GLM 的 Messages 适配器仍然发送 Z.ai 文档中的 "
"token 预算。运行时不会协商支持的等级。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:534
msgid ""
"``OFF`` is not a universal guarantee of zero reasoning: OpenAI adapters "
"omit explicit effort configuration, while some other adapters disable "
"thinking. The endpoint's default may still reason. Raising the level "
"never guarantees visible reasoning text, a better answer, or a particular"
" price. Set a default for the whole agent with ``create_agent(model, "
"reasoning_effort=...)`` and override it per request."
msgstr ""
"``OFF`` 并不是零推理的通用保证：OpenAI "
"适配器会省略显式强度配置，而其他一些适配器则关闭思考。端点的默认设置仍可能进行推理。提高级别绝不保证出现可见的推理文本、更好的答案或特定的价格。可以用"
" ``create_agent(model, reasoning_effort=...)`` 为整个智能体设置默认值，并按请求覆盖它。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:542
msgid "Retries and proxies"
msgstr "重试与代理"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:544
msgid ""
"``RetryOptions`` retries only *before* the first streamed event, so a "
"failure halfway through an answer never replays visible text or tool "
"fragments."
msgstr "``RetryOptions`` 只在第一个流式事件\\ *之前*\\ 重试，因此答案进行到一半时发生的失败绝不会重放已经可见的文本或工具片段。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:555
msgid ""
"Default transports honor ``HTTP_PROXY``, ``HTTPS_PROXY``, ``ALL_PROXY``, "
"and ``NO_PROXY``. Pass your own transport when you need custom routing."
msgstr ""
"默认传输会遵循 ``HTTP_PROXY``、``HTTPS_PROXY``、``ALL_PROXY`` 和 ``NO_PROXY``\\ "
"。当你需要自定义路由时，请传入自己的传输。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:558
msgid ""
"``max_retries=3`` permits up to four transport attempts: the initial one "
"plus three retries. Authentication and validation failures are not "
"blindly retried. The policy belongs to the model adapter, not "
"``create_agent``. For a total request deadline, see :doc:`application`. A"
" silent provider is bounded by the timeouts in the next section, and a "
"timeout is not retried."
msgstr ""
"``max_retries=3`` 最多允许四次传输尝试：一次初始请求加三次重试。认证和校验失败不会被盲目重试。该策略属于模型适配器，而不是 "
"``create_agent``\\ 。如需整个请求的总截止时间，请参阅 :doc:`application`\\ "
"。静默的提供方由下一节的超时限制，而且超时不会重试。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:567
msgid "When the provider goes quiet"
msgstr "当提供方不再响应"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:569
msgid ""
"A provider that takes the request and never answers used to be waited on "
"for ten minutes, and then asked three more times; the Google and Ollama "
"adapters waited forever. Every adapter now gives up, and says which wait "
"ran out. :class:`~zett_agent.model.TimeoutOptions` has one limit for each"
" stretch where nothing may arrive:"
msgstr ""
"以前，如果提供方收下请求之后一直不回应，会被等待十分钟，然后再被请求三次；Google 和 Ollama "
"适配器则会永远等下去。现在每个适配器都会放弃，并说明是哪一段等待超时了。\\ "
":class:`~zett_agent.model.TimeoutOptions` 为每个“不会有任何数据到达”的阶段各设置了一个限制："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:579
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制项"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:580
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:581
msgid "What it bounds"
msgstr "限制的是什么"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:582
msgid "``connect``"
msgstr "``connect``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:583
msgid "5 s"
msgstr "5 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:584
msgid "Opening the connection. A reachable host answers in milliseconds."
msgstr "建立连接。可以访问的主机会在几毫秒内应答。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:585
msgid "``first_byte``"
msgstr "``first_byte``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:586
msgid "60 s"
msgstr "60 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:587
msgid ""
"From sending the request to receiving the response *headers*. Streaming "
"APIs answer the headers before the model has produced anything, so a long"
" wait here means a gateway that took the request and did nothing."
msgstr "从发出请求到收到响应*头*。流式 API 会在模型产出任何内容之前就返回响应头，所以这里等了很久，说明有网关收下了请求却什么也没做。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:590
msgid "``idle``"
msgstr "``idle``"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:591
msgid "600 s"
msgstr "600 秒"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:592
msgid ""
"The longest gap between two chunks once the response has started. It is "
"long because a reasoning model may think silently."
msgstr "响应开始之后，两个数据块之间允许的最长间隔。它设得很长，因为推理模型可能会安静地思考。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:605
msgid ""
"There is deliberately no limit on the *total* time: a long answer that "
"keeps streaming is healthy. Set a limit to ``None`` to switch it off. A "
"limit that runs out raises "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderTimeoutError`, whose ``phase``"
" is ``\"connect\"``, ``\"first_byte\"`` or ``\"idle\"``."
msgstr ""
"我们刻意不限制*总*时长：持续流出的长回答是正常的。把某个限制设为 ``None`` 即可关闭它。某个限制耗尽时会抛出 "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderTimeoutError`，其 ``phase`` 为 "
"``\"connect\"``、``\"first_byte\"`` 或 ``\"idle\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:610
msgid ""
"A timeout is **not retried**, except for a failed connection. Retrying a "
"silent provider waits the whole limit a second time, and the first "
"request may still be running, and billed, on the other side. If the "
"response had already started when it went quiet, what arrived was "
"delivered, so a UI has shown it; the request then fails rather than "
"restarting."
msgstr ""
"超时\\ "
"**不会重试**，连接失败除外。重试一个静默的提供方，要把整个限制时间再等一遍，而且第一次请求可能仍在对方那里运行并计费。如果响应已经开始后才安静下来，已经到达的内容会被送达，所以界面上已经显示了；此时请求会失败，而不是重新开始。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:617
msgid ""
"The Google and Ollama clients send their request when the first chunk is "
"asked for, so for them ``first_byte`` covers connecting, the response "
"headers and the first chunk, and the connection has no limit of its own. "
"Ollama's default allows ten minutes for that first chunk, because a local"
" model may need to be loaded from disk first."
msgstr ""
"Google 和 Ollama 的客户端要等到被索取第一个数据块时才发出请求，所以对它们来说，``first_byte`` "
"涵盖连接、响应头和第一个数据块，连接本身没有单独的限制。Ollama 的默认值给第一个数据块留了十分钟，因为本地模型可能需要先从磁盘加载。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:624
msgid "When the provider answers with a web page"
msgstr "当提供方回答的是一个网页"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:626
msgid ""
"Between you and a provider there is often a reverse proxy, a gateway, a "
"firewall or a captive portal. When that fails it answers with an HTML "
"page, a bare line of text, or nothing, and a failure used to be reduced "
"to \"Provider stream request failed\". The status, the provider's own "
"explanation, and the fact that it was a web page are now in the message:"
msgstr ""
"在你和提供方之间，往往还有反向代理、网关、防火墙或强制门户。它出故障时，会返回 HTML "
"页面、一行纯文本或者什么都没有，而这类失败以前都会被简化成“Provider stream request "
"failed”。现在，状态码、提供方自己的解释，以及它是一个网页这件事，都会写进错误信息："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:639
msgid ""
"Failures arrive as :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderHTTPError`,"
" which has ``status_code``, ``reason`` (the provider's own words, when "
"the body was a JSON error), ``preview`` and ``is_html``. A rejected "
"credential is still a "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderAuthError`, with the same "
"detail added. The SDK's own error stays on ``__cause__``."
msgstr ""
"失败会以 :class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderHTTPError` 的形式到达，它带有 "
"``status_code``、``reason``\\ （当响应体是 JSON 错误时，提供方自己的话）、``preview`` 和 "
"``is_html``\\ 。被拒绝的凭据仍然是 "
":class:`~zett_agent.providers.base.ProviderAuthError`，并附上同样的细节。SDK "
"自己的错误保留在 ``__cause__`` 上。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:645
msgid ""
"A streaming request that is answered with a web page or with JSON is an "
"error too, whatever the status. A ``200`` with a login page, or with JSON"
" because the gateway does not stream, used to be read as a successful "
"reply with no text; it is now raised, naming the content type and what "
"the body said. Any other content type is read as a stream, because some "
"gateways send one as ``text/plain``, and a stream that ends without a "
"single event is raised as an error."
msgstr ""
"对流式请求，只要回答的是网页或 JSON，无论状态码是什么，也都算错误。以前，带登录页的 ``200``，或者因为网关不支持流式而返回的 "
"JSON，会被当作一次没有文本的成功回复；现在它们会被抛出，并指出内容类型和响应体说了什么。其他任何内容类型都按流来读取，因为有些网关会把流以 "
"``text/plain`` 发送；一个流如果连一个事件都没有就结束，会作为错误抛出。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:653
msgid "Streams that end early or carry broken tool calls"
msgstr "提前结束或携带损坏工具调用的流"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:655
msgid "Providers keep a request alive through three failures that used to end it."
msgstr "过去有三种失败会让请求终止，现在模型提供商会让请求在这些失败中继续。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:657
msgid ""
"**Malformed or truncated tool arguments.** If a tool call's JSON is "
"invalid, for example because the response hit its output limit or a "
"gateway cut the stream, the call is not run. It becomes a failed tool "
"result that says what happened and how to retry, so the model can resend "
"a smaller call. Slightly malformed but complete JSON is still repaired "
"silently. A cut-off payload is never completed by guesswork, because that"
" could write truncated content. ``AnthropicProvider(max_tokens=...)`` "
"sets the per-response output budget (default 16384); raise it for large "
"writes, or lower it for a model with a smaller limit."
msgstr ""
"**格式错误或被截断的工具参数。** 如果工具调用的 JSON "
"无效，例如响应达到了输出上限或网关截断了流，这次调用就不会执行。它会变成一条失败的工具结果，说明发生了什么以及如何重试，这样模型就可以重新发送一个更小的调用。轻微格式错误但完整的"
" JSON 仍会被静默修复。被截断的载荷绝不会靠猜测补全，因为那样可能写入被截断的内容。\\ "
"``AnthropicProvider(max_tokens=...)`` 设置每次响应的输出预算（默认 "
"16384）；写入量大时可调高，模型上限较小时可调低。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:666
msgid ""
"**Responses ``error`` events.** A mid-stream ``error`` event (rate limit,"
" overload) is raised with its own code and message instead of surfacing "
"as a missing terminal response."
msgstr ""
"**Responses 的 ``error`` 事件。** 流中途出现的 ``error`` "
"事件（限流、过载）会带着自己的代码和消息抛出，而不会表现为缺少终止响应。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:669
msgid ""
"**Responses streams without a terminal event.** If a gateway drops "
"``response.completed`` after every output item finished, the finished "
"items are used and ``finish_reason`` is ``\"incomplete\"``. If an item "
"never finished, or nothing arrived, the stream raised "
"``ProviderResponseError``; an empty stream is retried because nothing had"
" been shown yet."
msgstr ""
"**没有终止事件的 Responses 流。** 如果网关在每个输出项都完成之后丢弃了 "
"``response.completed``，那么已完成的项会被使用，``finish_reason`` 为 "
"``\"incomplete\"``\\ 。如果有某个项从未完成，或者什么都没到达，流就会抛出 "
"``ProviderResponseError``；空流会被重试，因为此时还没有展示任何内容。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:676
msgid "Prompt caching"
msgstr "提示词缓存"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:678
msgid ""
"The runtime derives a prompt-cache key from the session, so every step of"
" one conversation can use the same routing hint on endpoints that support"
" it. Cache reuse and savings remain provider decisions, not runtime "
"guarantees. Set ``cache_key`` on "
":class:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunConfig` to route several conversations "
"onto one prefix, or construct a provider with "
"``send_prompt_cache_key=False`` when an endpoint rejects the field."
msgstr ""
"运行时从会话派生出提示词缓存键，因此在支持该功能的端点上，同一对话的每一步都可以使用相同的路由提示。缓存复用和节省仍由提供商决定，而不是运行时的保证。在"
" :class:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunConfig` 上设置 "
"``cache_key``，可以把多个对话路由到同一个前缀；当端点拒绝该字段时，可以用 "
"``send_prompt_cache_key=False`` 构造提供商。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:685
msgid ""
"OpenAI sends the key by default. DeepSeek omits it by default because its"
" first-party service caches automatically; enable it only for a gateway "
"that expects it. Other adapters may not expose cache routing."
msgstr "OpenAI 默认会发送该键。DeepSeek 默认省略它，因为其自有服务会自动缓存；只有网关需要时才应启用。其他适配器可能不提供缓存路由。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:689
msgid ""
"``cache_mode`` on the run narrows what one request may cache. "
"``CacheMode.READ`` reuses a cached prefix without marking this request's new "
"content for caching; ``READ_WRITE`` (the default) also extends the cache to "
"the conversation so far; ``OFF`` sends no cache directive. Anthropic has "
"explicit breakpoints, so ``READ`` there marks the tool and system prefix but "
"not the newest turn. OpenAI-style endpoints cache automatically and have no "
"client-side write control: ``READ`` and ``READ_WRITE`` behave the same, and "
"``OFF`` only suppresses ``prompt_cache_key``. Google caches automatically and "
"ignores the mode. No provider offers strictly read-only cache access: a warm "
"prefix is read without writing, but a cold prefix is written on a miss."
msgstr "运行配置里的 ``cache_mode`` 可以收窄单个请求允许使用缓存的范围。\\ ``CacheMode.READ`` 复用已缓存的前缀，但不把本次请求的新内容标记为缓存；``READ_WRITE``\\ （默认值）还会把缓存扩展到当前对话；``OFF`` 不发送任何缓存指令。Anthropic 使用显式断点，因此 ``READ`` 只标记工具和 system 前缀，不标记最新一轮。OpenAI 风格的端点会自动缓存，客户端无法控制写入：``READ`` 与 ``READ_WRITE`` 行为相同，``OFF`` 只会省略 ``prompt_cache_key``\\ 。Google 自动缓存并忽略该模式。没有提供商提供严格只读的缓存访问：前缀已暖时只读不写，但前缀未命中时仍会写入。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:699
msgid ""
"When a provider reports cache hits, ``ModelUsage.cache_read_tokens`` and "
"``cache_hit_rate`` expose them. Requests through gateways that translate "
"protocols often omit the breakdown; ``ModelUsage.cache_reported`` is then"
" ``False``, which distinguishes \"unknown\" from a measured 0% miss."
msgstr ""
"当提供商报告缓存命中时，``ModelUsage.cache_read_tokens`` 和 ``cache_hit_rate`` "
"会将其暴露出来。经过协议转换网关的请求往往会省略明细；此时 ``ModelUsage.cache_reported`` 为 "
"``False``，从而区分“未知”和实测的 0% 未命中。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:695
msgid "Always release the adapter"
msgstr "始终释放适配器"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:697
msgid ""
"The client does not own a provider you passed in. Close it when the "
"application is done, even if several clients shared it:"
msgstr "客户端并不拥有你传入的提供商。应用结束时请关闭它，即使多个客户端共享同一个提供商："

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:705
msgid "Changing models mid-conversation"
msgstr "对话中途更换模型"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:707
msgid ""
"Pass ``model=other_model`` to ``run`` or ``stream`` to override the "
"default for one request. Ordinary messages and local tools remain "
"provider-neutral, but vision support and hosted tools must still match "
"the new endpoint. Signed reasoning/replay blocks are retained only for "
"the provider/model identity that can consume them; do not treat them as "
"portable instructions."
msgstr ""
"把 ``model=other_model`` 传给 ``run`` 或 "
"``stream``，即可为单个请求覆盖默认值。普通消息和本地工具仍然与提供商无关，但视觉支持和托管工具必须与新端点匹配。带签名的推理/重放块只保留给能够消费它们的提供商/模型标识；不要把它们当作可移植的指令。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:713
msgid ""
"Next: :doc:`streaming`, or write your own adapter in :doc:`../extending"
"/model-adapter`."
msgstr "下一步：:doc:`streaming`，或者按照 :doc:`../extending/model-adapter`\\ 编写你自己的适配器。"

