#~ "``XHIGH``, ``MAX``, and ``ULTRA`` to "
#~ "``high``. Budget-based adapters also "
#~ "group the highest levels. OpenAI Chat"
#~ " Completions forwards named levels, so "
#~ "a model that rejects one can still"
#~ " raise an endpoint error. OpenRouter "
#~ "sends the level as ``reasoning.effort``; "
#~ "Kimi and GLM send the three levels"
#~ " they know (``low``, ``high``, ``max``) "
#~ "and only to the models that take"
#~ " them. The runtime does not negotiate"
#~ " supported levels."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "当前的 Responses 适配器会把 ``XHIGH``、``MAX`` 和 "
#~ "``ULTRA`` 映射为 ``high``\\ "
#~ "。基于预算的适配器也会把最高几个级别归为一组。OpenAI Chat Completions "
#~ "会原样转发具名级别，因此如果模型拒绝其中某个级别，仍可能抛出端点错误。OpenRouter 把级别作为 "
#~ "``reasoning.effort`` 发送；Kimi 和 GLM "
#~ "只发送它们认识的三个级别（``low``、``high``、``max``），并且只发给支持这些字段的模型。运行时不会就支持的级别进行协商。"

